A braced span cannot close beyond its bracket run

```
[{^a]^}
.
<p>[{^a]^}</p>
```

```
[{,a],}
.
<p>[{,a],}</p>
```

```
[{*a]*}
.
<p>[{*a]*}</p>
```

```
[{/a]/}
.
<p>[{/a]/}</p>
```

```
[{+a]+}
.
<p>[{+a]+}</p>
```

```
[{-a]-}
.
<p>[{-a]-}</p>
```

```
[{~a]~}
.
<p>[{~a]~}</p>
```

```
[{_a]_}
.
<p>[{_a]_}</p>
```

```
[{=a]=}
.
<p>[{=a]=}</p>
```

```
[{~a ~> b]~}
.
<p>[{~a ~&gt; b]~}</p>
```

```
[{#a]#}
.
<p>[<span class="critic-comment">a]</span></p>
```

```
[{+a+}]
.
<p>[<ins>a</ins>]</p>
```

```
[{^a^}]
.
<p>[<sup>a</sup>]</p>
```
